      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplicate bug report. I can't agree what should be the primary bug report for this, but the most detailed candidates are:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/video-player-on-quest-doesnt-work\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/youtube-videos-fail-to-load-frequently\n\nUpstream yt-dlp issue: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/issues/17456\n\nI've detailed this issue on VRChat Ask: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/video-players-completely-broken/48829/2\n\nTL;DR: YouTube returns intermittent 403 Forbidden responses for `android_vr` downloads, which VRChat uses for YouTube playback. The upcoming yt-dlp stable release will add a client fallback to `web_embedded` if the `android_vr` fails to download the video.\n\nI also didn't read the log files if this is \"Sign-in to confirm you're not a bot\" or the upstream yt-dlp issue.",
